        "original_id": "4e687fc1-60bf-5409-a8a0-8ba6e7043cd5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Marwan Kenzari, Nicholas Hoult, Felicity Jones, Ben Kingsley, Anthony Hopkins\n- Films: Collide, Undiscovered\n- Awards: Golden Calf for Best Actor\n- Topics: box office percentage drop-off records\n\nFacts:\n- In 2013, Marwan Kenzari won the Golden Calf for Best Actor.\n- The film Collide stars Nicholas Hoult, Felicity Jones, Marwan Kenzari, Ben Kingsley, and Anthony Hopkins.\n- Until March 2017, the film Undiscovered held the record for the largest percentage drop-off in ticket sales from its opening weekend to its second weekend in theatrical release at 86.4%.\n- In March 2017, the film Collide broke Undiscovered's record for the largest percentage drop-off in ticket sales from opening weekend to second weekend in theatrical release.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
